                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "© 2015 ZeniMax Media Inc. Dishonored, Bethesda, Bethesda Softworks, ZeniMax and related logos are registered trademarks or trademarks of ZeniMax Media Inc. in the U.S. and/or other countries. Arkane and the Arkane logo are registered trademarks or trademarks of Arkane Studios SAS. All Rights Reserved.",
